WEBVTT

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.870
A brief rest helps the racers recover.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.750
Ah! Hot springs are truly the best!

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:21.370
Appare completes the hybrid engine
for the race's second half.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.950
Be careful, everyone! Drive safely!

00:01:59.580 --> 00:01:59.870
"North Platte, Nebraska"

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.620
"North Platte, Nebraska"
It's time for the race to resume!

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:03.000
"North Platte, Nebraska"
Thanks to the smooth
coordination of B.I.G. BOSS,

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.200
Thanks to the smooth
coordination of B.I.G. BOSS,

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:11.290
the drivers will be restarting
the race at the exact same time!

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:14.200
As a result, we will witness firsthand

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:20.700
whether train or automobile can
claim supremacy across the continent!

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:42.120
"Episode 10: The Bridge to Hell"

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:53.080
My acceleration isn't the best, but...!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.830
When it comes to top speed, I'm king!

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.580
Think you can pass, punk?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.700
Shall we dance?

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.620
This isn't a battle--it's a race!

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.660
Whew! I'm in love.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.200
We're dead last.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.790
And what about it? Tristan, load her up!

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:30.830
Right!

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:34.450
Out of all the cars, we pack the biggest punch!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.870
The real race starts now.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.700
Yeah! Let's show 'em!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.040
Cooling system #2, engaged!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.000
Steam and intake valves, fully open!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:59.120
All right! Hybrid mode! Let's do this!

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:02.830
Here we go!

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.200
The train leaves first!

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:12.080
With Xialian leading the pack,
Dylan, TJ, and Al are close behind!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:17.200
Trailing in the back are
the Bad Brothers and the Appare!

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.410
There you are, Appare!

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.950
Hmph. It's time for fun.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.660
Look and behold this spectacle!

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:44.290
Right now, the waves of a new era
are about to overtake the old!

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:49.410
Soon we will cross the landmark
of Missouri's railroad bridge!

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:54.450
Ultimately, will it be train or car
which conquers the bridge first?!

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:55.450
--Let us watch and see!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.660
--My money's on car.
--It's gotta be car.
--Let us watch and see!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:01.040
--The cars have better speed.
--Cars seem wonderful.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.410
Call him.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:05.410
Sir!

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:09.200
Do your best, everyone!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.120
I'm sorry for being so noisy.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.160
I just couldn't help myself.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:20.830
I understand. It's plenty exciting
just watching the race.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:26.750
It's unfortunate all that happened
or you might still be a part of it.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:33.200
It's okay. I'm just not cut out for
this sort of competition I guess.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.200
You're just too kind.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:43.410
Please, may everyone in the race finish safely.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.950
You're a kind one, too.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:51.040
I hope your prayers are answered by God.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.120
Thank you.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.250
--Excuse me, sir.
--Huh?

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.830
May I have a word?

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:00.160
Uh, sure. You'll have to excuse me.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.330
Sure.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.290
I'll be back soon.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:11.040
Mr. Cigar! What's the big idea?

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:16.200
I paid you a hefty sum to make sure
the race was put to a stop.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:23.080
If the racers cross the bridge before we do,
I'll be afraid to read the paper.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:27.950
Thanks to you, the course got changed
and the racers are at their best.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.080
The era of cars won't come.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:33.870
It'll be the railway that
dominates the continent.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.450
I hired you so the world would realize that.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.540
Hey! Are you listening?!

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:47.660
I'm telling you to stop that damn
Dylan and TJ whatever it takes!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.950
The only one I take orders from is me.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.660
What a poor listener.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.290
Now then, isn't it about time?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.790
We're coming up on the bridge!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.750
Yeah! Go for it!

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:33.700
Yeah! Go!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.450
Richard?

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:45.660
Your prayers won't be answered by God.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.080
Huh?

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.250
Ask me why.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.700
Why?

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:57.950
Because... I am Gil T. Cigar.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.580
Wake up, Snakes!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.410
What?!

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.200
Wh-What the?!

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:19.950
This entire train now belongs to Gil!

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.330
If you don't wanna die, stay seated!

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.410
The train's on fire!

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.000
Hey! The train's on--

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.700
I can see that!

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.080
Hey, guns! We're being shot at!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.870
I can see that!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:07.250
Did someone say party time?!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:37.540
Who are those guys?

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.000
Wasn't Sofia on the train?

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.410
Yeah...

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:45.000
Wait!

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:51.870
Please, help!

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.290
Oh! It's Richard!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:57.540
Don't!

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.330
Something's wrong.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.540
Huh?

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.500
Hey now. Not gonna come save me?

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.620
Talk about a cold-hearted crew.

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:14.700
If that was birdbrain Richard, he might be dead.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:19.000
Huh? You're not... Richard?

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:24.950
I see how it is.

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:27.870
His name was never Richard.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:30.120
That's right.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:33.410
Gil the Snake!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:40.790
Yup. My Snakes carve this emblem
on their bodies as proof of their loyalty.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:43.160
Then, you're...!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.370
Gil the Butcher.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.450
A pleasure to meet you.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:59.910
Why is Richard... Gil?

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.370
You're not the brightest, are you?

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:07.120
Did you really kill
five of my henchmen yourself?

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:10.700
I-I had no choice.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:15.000
No big deal. It's violence that rules our world.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:21.660
The strong live and the weak die.
That's all you were proving, right?

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.870
No! I...

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:30.620
Don't disagree with me. Next time, you're dead.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.200
Are the people on the train safe?!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:38.540
If you wanna talk, quit hiding, Al Lyon.
You that afraid of me?

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:43.830
Al!

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.200
Come back!

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.330
Are they safe?

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:53.160
Nah, that's not what you wanted to ask.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:56.330
"Is Sofia safe?"

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.330
What did you do to her?!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.870
This is answer enough.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.910
You bastard!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.790
Say hello to Sofia.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:16.620
Kosame!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.870
Hey!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.250
He's good!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:31.660
You guys aren't bad yourself.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:35.450
I'll make you wear my emblem and be my Snakes.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:37.500
Never!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:40.080
--Then die--
--Hey, hey, hey!

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:44.620
Quit acting cool against
these amateurs. It's embarrassing.

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:46.830
What's the big idea?

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:52.750
Babies who quit the race should go home
and suck their mama's titties.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:58.660
This pathetic race? It's so sad
how you're being paid to participate.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:02.580
If you want money, take it!
That's the outlaw way.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:05.000
--This race isn't pathetic!
You were part of it, too!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.200
--Hey, quit it!
--This race isn't pathetic!
You were part of it, too!

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.040
Stay out of this!

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.330
Is it money you're after?

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:16.160
It's pitiful. We were once the Thousand Seven
and feared by everyone.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.950
Now there's just three of us left.

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:25.450
What's more, one's a pansy coward
and one's plain crazy and all talk.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.700
I may be crazy, but I'm not all talk.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.500
I'll prove it to you right now.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:36.330
You're on. Let's have some fun
before I kick off the plan.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:43.700
If anyone tries to run, kill 'em.

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:48.830
Don't worry. They won't do anything
unless I give the order.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:52.200
Don't hold back. I'll take you both on at once.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.410
Screw you!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.410
Me, fight with this clown?!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.120
That's my line!

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.290
Then just sit and watch.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:04.120
Either way, this only ends
with both of you dead.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:16.580
I'm shifting gears. Can you keep up?

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:36.120
Now it's the Thousand Two.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.200
You change your mind?

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:45.000
I'm an outlaw. I do what I want.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:48.450
Dylan... You little...

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.450
You broke the rules first!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.450
He said to sit and watch--

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:03.870
Breaking the rules is one thing,
but my orders are absolute!

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.750
Too bad you're dead.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.500
His own comrade...

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.500
What a monster!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.830
That spoiled the fun.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:20.250
Good timing. Let's call it quits for today.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:26.040
Let's not forget I have hostages.
That means you, Al Lyon.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:28.040
You're staying behind!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.790
Al!

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:30.750
Sofia!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:36.080
I never said she was dead.
But it's all the same if you never see her.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:39.500
If you need hostages, take me instead!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.870
Please, just release her!

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.790
Not happening.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:50.000
You and the other B.I.G. BOSS lads
need to gather 1.51 million dollars.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:52.200
1.51 million...

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.580
The prize money for the race.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:59.370
It works out since you don't need
the prize or cars anymore.

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:04.290
'Cuz this is where your race comes to an end!

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.250
Get off the car!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.000
You're starting to get on my nerves.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:16.620
The race isn't over yet!
It won't stop for the likes of you!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:22.290
Don't order me around. Next time, you're dead.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:29.500
Understand? I have the power to
take everything precious from you guys.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:32.120
Right, Jing Xialian?

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:37.870
Such a nice car your pals on
the team put together for you.

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:40.790
What a waste on a woman.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.500
Dylan...

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:51.040
When did you?!

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:56.040
Claudia... What a fine woman.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.700
Keep your filthy hands off her!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:04.620
Claudia died because of you.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.830
Dylan...

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.540
Claudia...

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:30.080
If you stayed at her side,
you could've protected her, right?

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:36.000
But she died because you were
too obsessed with fighting your battles.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:40.200
No! I... It was to protect her!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:44.830
Did you really think rebuilding
the orphanage she was raised in

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.950
would do anything to atone for your sins?

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:49.410
How do you...?!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:54.950
You're the one who killed Claudia!

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:20.500
You're a cunning boy
to avenge your father like you did.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.540
Next time, I'll kill your mother.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.910
Think you can avenge her then?

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.500
You bastard!

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:38.700
You understand? This is power!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:43.500
I take what I want and destroy what I hate.

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:51.040
Whether cars are invented or the rails expand,
no new world will come.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:53.750
Because as long as I live,

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:58.160
the only thing that will
dominate this world is power!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:06.620
See?! Nobody can stop me!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.620
Do it!

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.870
Stop it...

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:22.410
Stop it!

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:24.910
I said I'd kill you.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.910
Kosame?

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:40.500
Oh, didn't see that coming.

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.750
It's not gonna happen.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:46.950
Appare... is my hope!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:52.580
I won't let someone like you... kill... him...

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.830
What have you done?! Kosame? Kosame!

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:59.830
Whatever. I'll let you
off the hook with his life.

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:06.750
Find me when you've got the money.
Hurry, 'cuz I'm impatient!

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.200
Where are you going?!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.160
You won't get away!

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.580
Move it! Move it!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.200
Sofia!

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.080
Al!

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.200
Sofia!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.120
Al!

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:42.080
Sofia!

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:49.450
What's happening?! Why?! Why did Kosame...?!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:54.500
I was just... doing what I wanted to do.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:03.000
It's not every day... I get to see you panic.

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.540
Enough! Don't talk!

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:09.290
It's no use. There's too much blood.
If we don't get him to a hospital...

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:16.000
Shit! Move! Move, dammit!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.160
Why at a time like this?!

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:20.250
Shit!

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:23.080
Appare... Appare...

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:29.040
I'll look for another car. Keep pressure on it.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:32.660
Kosame, hang in there! Kosame!

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:39.750
Calm down... That's the... best part of you...

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.950
What are you saying at a time like this?!

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:46.040
Don't give up, Appare...

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.950
The race isn't over yet.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:58.700
Right? If it's you, you'll reach the finish.

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:02.450
Here we go...

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:08.200
No, Kosame!

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:12.200
Hang in there! Kosame!

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:15.620
Kosame!

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:47.450
"Next time"

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:49.910
"Episode 11: Rain in the Dark Night"
